+embedding application must additionally hold its shared admission fence across
+the entire dispatch. The native `turn/start` protocol has no expected-turn
+compare-and-start field: another native writer outside that fence can still
+race the final observation. This library does not provide atomic exclusion
+against such a writer. Continuation does not replay original input or tools,
